{"ch": 94, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "اَلَمۡ نَشۡرَحۡ لَکَ صَدۡرَکَ ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "Have We not opened for thee thy bosom,", "w": ["have not", "We opened", "for thee", "thy bosom", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "وَوَضَعۡنَا عَنۡکَ وِزۡرَکَ ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "And removed from thee thy burden", "w": ["and removed", "from thee", "thy burden", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "الَّذِیۡۤ اَنۡقَضَ ظَہۡرَکَ ۙ﴿۴﴾", "en": "Which had <i>well nigh</i> broken thy back,", "w": ["which", "had <i>well nigh</i> broken", "thy back", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "وَرَفَعۡنَا لَکَ ذِکۡرَکَ ؕ﴿۵﴾", "en": "And We exalted thy name?", "w": ["and We exalted", "thy", "name", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "فَاِنَّ مَعَ الۡعُسۡرِ یُسۡرًا ۙ﴿۶﴾", "en": "Surely there is ease after hardship.", "w": ["surely", "after", "hardship", "there is ease", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "اِنَّ مَعَ الۡعُسۡرِ یُسۡرًا ؕ﴿۷﴾", "en": "<i>Aye</i>, surely there is ease after hardship.", "w": ["<i>aye</i>, surely", "after", "after hardship", "there is ease", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "فَاِذَا فَرَغۡتَ فَانۡصَبۡ ۙ﴿۸﴾", "en": "So when thou art free, strive hard,", "w": ["so when", "thou art free", "strive hard", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "وَاِلٰی رَبِّکَ فَارۡغَبۡ ﴿٪۹﴾", "en": "[✲]And to thy Lord do thou attend <i>whole-heartedly</i>.", "w": ["and to", "thy Lord", "do thou attend <i>whole-heartedly</i>", ""]}]}